<!--
    Debug-only launcher background: the release icon with its colours inverted.

    Debug builds install alongside a real one (see applicationIdSuffix in build.gradle.kts),
    and two identical icons on the launcher are easy to confuse - which matters here,
    because the two apps hold different databases and the real one holds data that cannot
    be recovered if it is lost.

    Only the background is overridden. The foreground logo is a .webp and stays as-is, so
    the icon is recognisably the same app, just unmistakably not the release build.

    Inverted from the release colours:
      #3DDC84 -> #C2237B   (green -> magenta)
      #33FFFFFF -> #33000000   (white grid -> black grid, same alpha)
-->
